<title>FRANCE: EU cuts daily wheat export refund to Switzerland.</title>
<headline>EU cuts daily wheat export refund to Switzerland.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union has cut the daily refund applying to soft wheat exports to Switzerland, Liechstenstein and the Spanish territories of Ceuta and Melilla to 7.50 Ecus per tonne from a previous level of 9.50 Ecus, grain industry sources said on Friday.</p>
<p>The EU also cut the refund on barley exports to the same destinations to 20.50 Ecus per tonne from 21.00 Ecus.</p>
<p>The EU's grain committee took the decisions at its weekly meeting on Thursday.</p>
<p>--Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
